  "scope": [
    "The concurrency tests park a source-free bundle after its cut at the point where companion copying starts. A normal room write completes and is excluded from restore. A separate case advances the epoch there and observes refusal from the original host.",
    "The source and installed handovers carry the actual 40-event discussion archive through the copy and verification path. They refuse missing or incomplete inputs and reopen the original after acceptance and restart.",
    "This changes when the companion copies hold the serving permit. Native and raster capture still uses the initial room transaction. Other participant journals and upload inputs use their original handover contract."
  ]
